WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.690
Looking for an apartment to rent?

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:04.600
In the MyKey demo,
choose “Apartment”

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:06.720
and “For Rent”
to see matching listings.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.760
Open one to check the details,

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:11.830
then save it to your favourites
so you can come back to it later.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.750
In the Sada concept, a student
opens a lesson and starts learning.

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:17.850
Each project serves a different need,

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:20.180
and each makes the next step
easy to find.
